      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you don't feel \"safe\" then I highly recommend you uninstall the platform immediately. There is no reason to put yourself under such massive stress, removing yourself would be best. VRC despite its many challenges do ban people as they find them, however most measures they are currently equipped to take are very easy to circumvent. If you wish to have them address security as a higher focus, it might be best to re-evaluate this concern, identify key points and take it from the overall security detection and response of VRC.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
