      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It should be noted that 95% of people claiming to \"hack\" or DDoS online are full of it. They wouldn't even know where to begin and are just throwing out words to sound big and bad. Even if they did have you IP and did something, its rarely more than dropping you off the internet. They can't \"damage\" it.\nAutomated systems don't work because they are easily abusable. If you put into place an automatic ban system that banned after 15 reports, people would just get 14 of their friends to report someone they don't like to get them banned. The very same people you want banned would literally team together in their discord to have you banned. I doubt that is what you want.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
